Package: qore-magic-module
Architecture: any
Depends: ${qore:Depends},
         ${shlibs:Depends},
         ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-magic-module-doc
Description: file type and MIME detection module for Qore
 This module identifies files and buffers using libmagic, including their
 MIME types and character encodings. It uses the system file-type database.
 Compiler metadata is included for Qore's tools.

Package: qore-magic-module-doc
Section: doc
Architecture: all
Multi-Arch: foreign
Build-Profiles: <!nodoc>
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Suggests: qore-magic-module
Description: documentation and examples for Qore's magic module
 This package contains the HTML API reference, example tests and image/text
 fixtures for Qore's file detection module.
